003e\u003cspan style\u003d\u0027font-size: 14px; font-family: \"times new roman\", serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\u0027\u003e\u0026nbsp;Agile5 Technologies, Inc., is a Woman-Owned Small Business (WOSB) and Information Technology (IT) services firm that specializes in the design, development, testing, integration, and maintenance of enterprise software systems. We believe our employees are the company\u0026rsquo;s most valuable asset. We are invested in seeing our employees grow in their careers, while maintaining a work/life balance. We have an immediate need for a skilled, energetic, and driven Data Scientist (1099 Independent Contractor).\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir\u003d\"ltr\" style\u003d\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\u0027font-size: 14px; font-family: \"times new roman\", serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\u0027\u003eDescription:\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\u0027font-size: 14px; font-family: \"times new roman\", serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\u0027\u003e\u0026nbsp;The Data Scientist will work as a 1099 Independent Contractor on a part-time, as-needed basis to execute discrete, task-focused projects that solve complex internal data science problems. This role involves analyzing organizational datasets, engineering predictive machine learning models, and delivering actionable business intelligence to optimize technical and operational capabilities. Working closely with internal leadership, software, cloud, and cybersecurity teams, the ideal candidate will translate complex data findings into clear reports, dashboards, and automated solutions.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir\u003d\"ltr\" style\u003d\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\u0027font-size: 14px; font-family: \"times new roman\", serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\u0027\u003eData Scientist (1099 Independent Contractor) Job Duties:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul style\u003d\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-inline-start:48px;\"\u003e\u003cli dir\u003d\"ltr\" style\u003d\u0027list-style-type: disc; font-size: 14px; font-family: \"times new roman\", serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\u0027\u003e\u003cp dir\u003d\"ltr\" style\u003d\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eExecute discrete, task-based data science assignments to enhance internal technical capabilities and operational efficiency.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli dir\u003d\"ltr\" style\u003d\u0027list-style-type: disc; font-size: 14px; font-family: \"times new roman\", serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\u0027\u003e\u003cp dir\u003d\"ltr\" style\u003d\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eAnalyze complex internal datasets to uncover trends, patterns, statistical correlations, and anomalies.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli dir\u003d\"ltr\" style\u003d\u0027list-style-type: disc; font-size: 14px; font-family: \"times new roman\", serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\u0027\u003e\u003cp dir\u003d\"ltr\" style\u003d\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eDesign, build, test, and deploy custom machine learning algorithms and predictive models to address targeted business problems.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli dir\u003d\"ltr\" style\u003d\u0027list-style-type: disc; font-size: 14px; font-family: \"times new roman\", serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\u0027\u003e\u003cp dir\u003d\"ltr\" style\u003d\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eCollaborate with internal software engineering, cloud, and cybersecurity teams to integrate data science models into broader technical frameworks.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli dir\u003d\"ltr\" style\u003d\u0027list-style-type: disc; font-size: 14px; font-family: \"times new roman\", serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\u0027\u003e\u003cp dir\u003d\"ltr\" style\u003d\"lin